     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I would like to dispay a leaflet map  developed using js as opposed to the leaflet package in R.  I have an example map e.g., <a href=\"http://portal.gulfcouncil.org/Anthiaswoodsi.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://portal.gulfcouncil.org/Anthiaswoodsi.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792395594231000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Afb81GuB2dWeD-x00atPX\">http://portal.gulfcouncil.org/Anthiaswoodsi.html</a> that I cannot get working on the shiny apps server: <a href=\"https://gulfcouncilportal.shinyapps.io/iframetest/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gulfcouncilportal.shinyapps.io/iframetest/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792395594231000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1nXSUT5xZwyApnify5ljKj\">https://gulfcouncilportal.shinyapps.io/iframetest/</a> .  The example works as expected locally when viewed in a browser.  Any ideas greatly appreciated.  Sample code to reproduce the example is below.<div><br></div><div>ui.R </div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Define UI for application that draws a histogram</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>shinyUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    mainPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      tags$iframe</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">src </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;<a href=\"http://portal.gulfcouncil.org/Anthiaswoodsi.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://portal.gulfcouncil.org/Anthiaswoodsi.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792395594231000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Afb81GuB2dWeD-x00atPX\">http://portal.gulfcouncil.org/Anthiaswoodsi.html</a>&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> seamless</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">NA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> height</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">500</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> width</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">500</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>server.R</div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Define server logic required to draw a histogram</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br> <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span></div></code>